# EAS archives from the GIT ROOT, and this is a monorepo (eas.json lives in
# mobile/), so this file must live here — a mobile/.easignore alone is not
# enough for the upload archive.
#
# IMPORTANT: use UNANCHORED patterns (no leading path segment). A pattern that
# starts with a directory, e.g. "mobile/store-assets/", is resolved relative to
# the project root (mobile/) and therefore looks for mobile/mobile/store-assets/
# — it silently matches nothing. That is exactly why the archive sat at 43.8 MB
# with store-assets supposedly excluded: only the unanchored "**/node_modules/"
# rule was biting, which took it from 84.6 MB to 43.8 MB and no further.
#
# Uploads on this link drop with ECONNRESET partway through, so keeping the
# archive small is what makes builds finish at all. Excluding the two
# directories below takes it from ~44 MB to ~5 MB.

# Dependencies and VCS.
**/node_modules/
**/vendor/
**/.git/

# Marketing / store-listing assets — ~41 MB of screenshots, iPad captures and a
# 13 MB zip. Uploaded to App Store Connect and Play by hand; never part of the
# app binary.
store-assets/
**/store-assets/

# Local Expo build artifacts and caches (~3 MB), regenerated on demand.
.expo/
.expo-shared/
.expo-tmp-export/
**/.expo/
**/.expo-shared/
**/.expo-tmp-export/

# Secrets that must never be uploaded.
**/*firebase-adminsdk*.json
**/*-service-account*.json
**/play-service-account.json
**/credentials.json
**/credentials/
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
